Replaces: rx550-g5-be-kernel, rx550-g5-be-mesa
Description: Radeon RX 550 support for big-endian Power Mac G5
 Boot integration for the big-endian amdgpu kernel and Mesa packages: makes
 GRUB start the -rx550g5 kernel, loads amdgpu before the display manager with
 the options a Power Mac G5 needs, configures X for the RX 550, and pins the
 Mesa packages so that other repositories do not replace them.
